Package: cata
Type: Package
Title: Analysis of Check-All-that-Apply (CATA) Data
Version: 0.1.2.0
Date: 2026-07-31
Author: J.C. Castura [aut, cre, ctb] (ORCID:
    <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1640-833X>)
